# Same generator, same reason, for the per-service Env-only half
# (`wrangler types --include-runtime=false`). Scoped to each service's
# package root so it does not also swallow hand-written `src/env.d.ts` files
# (secret bindings), which are ordinary linted/formatted source.
services/*/env.d.ts

# Markdown is deliberately outside the format gate.
#
# Prettier pads Markdown table columns to the width of the widest cell. The
# tables in docs/ carry paragraph-length rationale, so padding them produces
# 1500-character lines and makes every subsequent edit re-flow the whole table.
# The prose in this repo is written by humans for humans; Prettier's value here
# is on code and config, not narrative.
*.md
**/*.md
